["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/AssemblyProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The AssemblyProcess represents the process of creating a product by assembling a set of components, potentially in a way that allows for at disassembly (at least partially).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
